# Unruly Catapult untaps only for an instant or sorcery spell YOU cast. On turn 3 it taps (Bot2 19) and Bot1 casts a creature
# spell (Dwarven Trader) and an artifact spell (Mox Emerald): it stays tapped. On turn 4 Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt (an instant,
# at Bot1: 17): it is still tapped, Bot2 never untaps it.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Unruly Catapult
Mountain
Mountain
Dwarven Trader
Mox Emerald
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

